{"id":"n74193-2-0","stage":4,"title":"놈 · 小伙子","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74193-2-0-1","ko":"저기 놀이터에서 놀고 있는 놈이 제 아들입니다.","zh":"那边在游乐场玩耍的那个孩子是我儿子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀이터에서","meaning":"游乐场","explanation":"놀이터：游乐场；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"놀이터","audio":"/audio/cac9ffa4c39d8c15ba9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40768","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀이터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀고","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놈이","meaning":"小伙子","explanation":"놈：小伙子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"놈","audio":"/audio/8cb9618fb00ec4c42e61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74193","senseId":"2","lemma":"놈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아들입니다.","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"cac9ffa4c39d8c15","term":"놀이터","zh":"游乐场","audio":"/audio/cac9ffa4c39d8c15ba9f.mp3","entryId":"40768","definition":"设有滑梯或秋千等器具、供孩子们玩乐的地方。","pronunciation":["노리터"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"8cb9618fb00ec4c4","term":"놈","zh":"小伙子","audio":"/audio/8cb9618fb00ec4c42e61.mp3","entryId":"74193","definition":"(昵称)男孩儿。","pronunciation":["놈"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f349944da65a3f2354b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74193-2-0-2","ko":"아, 그래요? 아저씨와 많이 닮았네요.","zh":"啊，是吗？他长得真像您啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래요?","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아저씨와","meaning":"大叔，叔叔","explanation":"아저씨：大叔，叔叔；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26237","senseId":"2","lemma":"아저씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"닮았네요.","meaning":"像，随","explanation":"닮다：像，随；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"哦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"由不知道而转向醒悟时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"14cf4d2fee0defcf","term":"아저씨","zh":"大叔，叔叔","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3","entryId":"26237","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼没有老的成年男子。","pronunciation":["아저씨"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"593cd68a24885987","term":"닮다","zh":"像，随","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3","entryId":"73354","definition":"指两个以上的人或事物拥有相似的长相或属性。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5b97ad92bfe6944260d6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.665,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74193","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3184,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那边在游乐场玩耍的那个孩子是我儿子。","啊，是吗？他长得真像您啊。","我是坐公交车来的。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那边在游乐场玩耍的那个孩子是我儿子。","啊，是吗？他长得真像您啊。","我是坐公交车来的。"],"answer":1}]}
